"""Verified temporal-star exploration generator for arXiv:2103.05387.

The paper defines a strict exploration of a temporal star as one visit to every
leaf, returning to the centre between leaves.  Instances here have ``n`` visit
slots: slot s consists of times 2s+1 and 2s+2.  Every edge is available in a
small set of slots.  Consequently an exploration is exactly a perfect matching
between star edges and slots.

Generation composes affine permutations of the cyclic slot set.  It samples the
permutations first and carries one of them as the exploration certificate; it
never solves the emitted matching instance.
"""

